That's up for debate.  If lawful, I like Greyswandir, but Excalibur is
definitely considered one of the best.  As neutral, Mjollnir and Frost
brand are good and Vorpal Blade's decapitation effect comes in handy.
Magicbane is also good (a wizard's best friend). For chaotic, Stormbringer
is the only way to go!!

